{"ref":"BDB, אַדִּיר","hw":"אַדִּיר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַדִּיר</span></big>  <strong>adj. majestic</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:2\" href=\"/Psalms.8.2\">ψ 8:2</a> +; <strong>f.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדֶּ֫רֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.8\">Ez 17:8</a>? (v. infr.) etc.—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> majestic</strong> (wide, lofty) of waters of sea <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:10\" href=\"/Exodus.15.10\">Ex 15:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 93:4\" href=\"/Psalms.93.4\">ψ 93:4</a>; a ship <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.21\">Is 33:21</a>; a tree <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.23\">Ez 17:23</a>; a vine <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.8\">Ez 17:8</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּפֶן אַדֶּרֶת</span>, so Fü; or <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> n. abstr. v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַדֶּ֫רֶת\" href=\"/BDB,_אַדֶּ֫רֶת\", dir=\"rtl\">אַדֶּרֶת</a> infr.); also fig. of kings <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:18\" href=\"/Psalms.136.18\">ψ 136:18</a>; nations <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.18\">Ez 32:18</a>; gods <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.8\">1 S 4:8</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 93:4\" href=\"/Psalms.93.4\">ψ 93:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 76:5\" href=\"/Psalms.76.5\">76:5</a>; of name of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:2\" href=\"/Psalms.8.2\">ψ 8:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:10\" href=\"/Psalms.8.10\">10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  subst. <em>majestic one</em>, of nobles, chieftains, etc., <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:13\" href=\"/Judges.5.13\">Ju 5:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:25\" href=\"/Judges.5.25\">25</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:6\" href=\"/Nahum.2.6\">Na 2:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:18\" href=\"/Nahum.3.18\">3:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.3\">Je 14:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.34\">25:34</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אַדִּירֵי הַצֹּאן</span> fig. so) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:35\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:36\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.21\">30:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.2\">Zc 11:2</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.20\">2 Ch 23:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.5\">Ne 3:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.30\">10:30</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:34\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.34\">Is 10:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.21\">33:21</a>; of servants of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:3\" href=\"/Psalms.16.3\">ψ 16:3</a> (= priests? cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.5\">1 Ch 24:5</a> & v. Che).","next":"BDB, אַדֶּ֫רֶת","prev":"BDB, אַדָּר"}